Si es del dos,
debe ser la manzana.

137
00:09:07,292 --> 00:09:10,125
Oye, ¿quieres usar
el desinfectante de manos?

138
00:09:10,208 --> 00:09:11,542
No, gracias.

139
00:09:11,625 --> 00:09:12,583
Yo...

140
00:09:12,667 --> 00:09:13,917
Aquí te espero.

141
00:09:16,375 --> 00:09:17,458
Sí.

142
00:09:18,333 --> 00:09:19,917
Veamos.

143
